1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A rapidly dissolving childhood living room, ornate wallpaper peeling into stardust., desperate.

2
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,300
Lyra: Get back! Not this one.

3
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,600
Echo Shard: Unburden yourself. It's dust.

4
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,900
Lyra: No! Mine. All mine!

5
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:15,200
Echo Shard: Pointless. Let go.

6
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:16,500
Lyra: Almost... got it!

7
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:25,800
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A twisting, unstable hallway, once familiar, now a maze of shifting walls and floorboards., urgent.

8
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,100
Lyra: Run! Faster!

9
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:29,400
Echo Shard: The path dissolves. You too.

10
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,700
Lyra: Not this time. Never!

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Echo Shard: Resistance is... futile.

12
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:34,300
Lyra: Move!

13
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:45,600
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A child's bedroom, partially intact but filled with the dust of forgotten dreams. Toys lie scattered, fading., tense.

14
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:46,900
Lyra: A room? Safe?

15
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:49,200
Kael: No… not safe. A lure.

16
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:50,500
Lyra: Trap!

17
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,800
Loom of Oblivion: A child's dream. So fragile.

18
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,100
Lyra: Not fragile enough!

19
00:00:55,400 --> 00:01:01,400
♪ at dawn, in A twisting, generic memory-corridor, walls shifting between mundane and fantastical, unstable., dread.

20
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:03,700
Lyra: Which way? It's all… shifting.

21
00:01:03,1000 --> 00:01:05,1000
Loom of Oblivion: Choose wisely. Or dissolve.

22
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:08,300
Lyra: No feelings. Just forward.

23
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:10,600
Kael: They feed… on emotion.

24
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:12,900
Lyra: Shut up, Kael! Focus!

25
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:20,200
♪ in broad daylight, in A fragmented marketplace memory, chaotic and crowded with fading, spectral figures., urgent.

26
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:22,500
Lyra: Too many faces. Distractions.

27
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:24,800
Echo Shard: A good memory. We preserve.

28
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:26,100
Lyra: No, you consume!

29
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:28,400
Echo Shard: It becomes us. Forever.

30
00:01:28,700 --> 00:01:30,700
Lyra: Not me. Not today!

31
00:01:31,1000 --> 00:01:39,1000
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A vast, echoing library of forgotten knowledge, shelves stretching into an infinite void., dread.

32
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:42,300
Lyra: A library? What is this?

33
00:01:42,600 --> 00:01:44,600
Loom of Oblivion: All forgotten knowledge resides.

34
00:01:44,900 --> 00:01:46,900
Kael: The path… is hidden.

35
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:49,200
Lyra: Hidden where? Tell me!

36
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:51,500
Loom of Oblivion: We choose your ending.

37
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:59,800
♪ at dusk, in A crumbling bridge spanning a chasm of forgotten dreams, jagged memory-fragments floating below., desperate.

38
00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:02,100
Lyra: Almost there! Don't look down!

39
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:03,400
Echo Shard: Fall. It's peaceful.

40
00:02:03,700 --> 00:02:05,700
Lyra: Never! Not for peace!

41
00:02:05,1000 --> 00:02:07,1000
Echo Shard: Your memories… are ours.

42
00:02:08,300 --> 00:02:09,300
Lyra: Mine!

43
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:17,600
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A dark, claustrophobic memory-tunnel, filled with whispering echoes and distorted reflections., dread.

44
00:02:17,900 --> 00:02:19,900
Lyra: Whispers… so many voices.

45
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:22,200
Kael: They know… your fears.

46
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:23,500
Lyra: Lies! All lies!

47
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:25,800
Loom of Oblivion: Embrace the void. It is truth.

48
00:02:26,100 --> 00:02:28,100
Lyra: No! Just… a way out!

49
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:37,400
♪ in broad daylight, in A chamber filled with fragmented schematics and glowing blueprints, a memory of Lyra's past work., desperate.

50
00:02:37,700 --> 00:02:38,700
Lyra: The blueprint! There!

51
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:41,000
Loom of Oblivion: This knowledge… is dangerous.

52
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:42,300
Lyra: Mine to use!

53
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:44,600
Loom of Oblivion: You waste them. Foolish.

54
00:02:44,900 --> 00:02:45,900
Lyra: Got it!

55
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:54,200
♪ under the cover of darkness, in A small, enclosed memory-space, momentarily stable, but vibrating with unseen energy., shock.

56
00:02:54,500 --> 00:02:56,500
Lyra: Safe! Just for a moment...

57
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:58,800
Loom of Oblivion: Nowhere is safe. Not from us.

58
00:02:59,100 --> 00:03:01,100
Lyra: What? No! It's too much!

59
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:03,400
Kael: Hold… tight. Don't… let go.

60
00:03:03,700 --> 00:03:05,700
Lyra: No! My locket! Stop!

61
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:16,000
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The shattered remnants of the 'safe' haven, now a void, Lyra lying amidst the glittering dust., dread.

62
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:17,300
Lyra: It's… gone.

63
00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:19,600
Loom of Oblivion: Liberated. From your grasp.

64
00:03:19,900 --> 00:03:21,900
Lyra: You… you took it.

65
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:26,200
Loom of Oblivion: And now… we know your next step. The Core.

66
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:28,500
Kael: No… Lyra. They… know.
